{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 18, :comments ["<b>נמו</b> — like לא ינום (they shall not slumber)." "<b>ישכנו</b> — like ישקטו (they shall be still), and they shall not move." "<b>נפושו</b> — נפזרו (they were scattered), and like it: ופשו פרשיו. And the meaning is like נפשטו, and like it: ויצאתם ופשתם."], :book :nahum, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 3, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Nahum -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/nachum"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:14:43.984621620Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}